Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:03.00,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:08.20,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another remarkable win for Guo Hanyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜又赢下了一场了不起的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:12.03,TL,,0,0,0,,主场的掌声 再次属于郭涵煜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:15.49,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}日下午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.26,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉女单第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:18.68,TL,,0,0,0,,外卡选手郭涵煜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:21.87,TL,,0,0,0,,对阵从资格赛打上来的沃利内茨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:26.42,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:28.26,TL,,0,0,0,,她连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}局反超
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:31.88,TL,,0,0,0,,盘点上 又主动上网把机会兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:50.95,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, wow!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:55.58,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Emphatically put away, and it is three in a row for Guo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍干脆利落 郭涵煜连赢三局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:11.85,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, never in doubt once she came into the net.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 她一上网 这分就稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:14.60,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a set that was.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘真精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:17.85,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Breaks of serve everywhere.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘频频破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:21.70,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But when Guo needed to step up and find the quality hold,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但在必须挺身而出保发时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:23.15,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}she did just that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:26.40,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-four, just over three-quarters of an hour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六比四 用时略超四十五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.81,0:01:30.13,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘先落后{\fs78}3{\fs68}局 她追回{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:32.57,TL,,0,0,0,,但最后两局都归了沃利内茨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.66,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛进入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:52.31,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This is a very good game, though.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不过 这一局的质量很高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.18,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:57.25,TL,,0,0,0,,郭涵煜在一局里救回{\fs78}5{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:02:01.15,TL,,0,0,0,,随后破发取得{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 却又遭到回破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:16.25,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wow!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:19.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}时 郭涵煜再次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:22.35,TL,,0,0,0,,可是{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}的发球胜赛局没能保住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:25.41,TL,,0,0,0,,连丢两局 反而{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:31.28,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 她只丢一分就保发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:34.89,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 抢七开局又连拿四分！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.20,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, has she made it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 这球进了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:49.95,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Has she found the line? I don't know.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N压到线了吗？我还不能确定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.95,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let's look. Yes, she has.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看一下 是的 压线了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:18.81,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's well played by Volynets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N沃利内茨这一分打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:22.38,TL,,0,0,0,,但{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 又被追到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:25.87,TL,,0,0,0,,随后{\fs78}3{\fs68}个回合 郭涵煜全部拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:42.06,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, yes!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好球！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:00.76,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:05.96,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another remarkable win for Guo Hanyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜又赢下了一场了不起的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:10.81,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, the win against Sorana Cirstea was a high point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N战胜索拉娜 科斯蒂亚已是一个高点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.01,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This is even better.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而这一场更胜一筹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:19.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}48{\fs68}记制胜分 {\fs78}23{\fs68}次上网 {\fs78}17{\fs68}次成功
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:22.93,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘鏖战 郭涵煜再闯一关
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:25.82,TL,,0,0,0,,下一轮迎战{\fs78}5{\fs68}号种子斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.13,TL,,0,0,0,,她还能继续突破吗？
